@baseUrl = http://localhost:5116
@unitId = replace-with-unit-id-from-create-response

### List units
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/units

### Create a unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/units
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetNumber": "VENT-001",
  "location": "Kontor, plan 2",
  "manufacturer": "Exempel",
  "model": "VX-100"
}

### Create an open service case for the unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/units/{{unitId}}/service-cases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Kontrollera filter",
  "description": "Fiktivt demoärende",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-10"
}

### List upcoming service cases
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/service-cases?due=upcoming
